docs {
  # AttendanceService.ListClasses

  The teacher's classes of a day, or a section's

  `/ltedu.attendance.v1.AttendanceService/ListClasses` · unary · `ltedu/attendance/v1/attendance.proto`

  ## Request — `ListClassesRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `day` | `string` |  |
  | `section_id` | `string` | Empty: the signed-in teacher's classes |

